{"title":"","icon":"","img":"","tags":"","hideInMenu":"false","text":"module","cls":"Wb.Module","properties":{"cid":"module","remark":"My home page"},"_icon":"module","_expanded":true,"items":[{"_icon":"viewport","text":"viewport1","cls":"Wb.Viewport","properties":{"cid":"viewport1","gap":".5em","droppable":"wb.home","autoScroll":"hide","border":"false","html":"<html>\n  <header>\n    <title>exception page</title>\n  </header>\n  <style>\n    .home{\n      text-align: center;\n      height:100%;\n      /* padding-top: 5%; */\n    }\n    .home .top-bar{\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n    }\n    .home .logo{\n      width:200px;\n      padding: 10px;\n    }\n    .home .bg{\n      width:100%;\n      height:300px;\n      background-image:url('wb/gtht/home/img/bg1.png');\n    }\n    .home .bg .title{\n      color:#fff;\n      font-size:40px;\n      /* padding-top:100px; */\n      height:300px;\n      line-height:300px;\n    }\n    .home .service-item .title{\n      color:#fff;\n      font-size:40px;\n      padding-top:80px;\n    }\n    .home .other-link{\n      width:50%;\n      margin:0 auto;\n    }\n    .home p{\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: -90px;\n      color: #666;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    } \n    .home .other-link{\n      width:60%;\n      margin:0 auto;\n      display:flex;\n      flex-wrap:wrap;\n      justify-content:space-around;\n      margin-top:50px;\n    }\n    .home .other-link .service-item{\n      width:160px;\n      margin-bottom:30px;\n      text-align:left;\n    }\n    .home .other-link .service-item .icon{\n      width:50px;\n      height:50px;\n      float:left;\n      margin-right:15px;\n    }\n    .home .other-link .service-item .title{\n      font-size:18px;\n      font-weight:bold;\n      color:#333;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    .home .other-link .service-item .desc{\n      font-size:14px;\n      color:#666;\n      line-height:1.5;\n    }\n  </style>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"home\">\n      <div class=\"top-bar\">\n        <img class=\"logo\" src=\"wb/gtht/home/img/gtja_logo.png\" />\n        <div id=\"username\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg\">\n        <div class=\"title\">投行合规管理系统</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"other-link\">\n        <div class=\"service-item\">\n          <img class=\"icon\" src=\"wb/gtht/home/img/icon1.png\" />\n          <div class=\"title\">企业多维查询</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">可通过企业名称、法人、地址、经营范围等4个维度的智能搜索，快速查询企业。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"service-item\">\n          <img class=\"icon\" src=\"wb/gtht/home/img/icon2.png\" />\n          <div class=\"title\">全景数据服务</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">除企业基本信息、工商信息外，可查询到多维度的企业舆情信息以及经营风险信息，方便掌握企业经营状况。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"service-item\">\n          <img class=\"icon\" src=\"wb/gtht/home/img/icon3.png\" />\n          <div class=\"title\">企业关系链图</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">基于投资关系、股东关系等多类企业关系进行关联，深度挖掘企业间关系、股权结构，以及企业实际控制人等，并可视化呈现。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"service-item\">\n          <img class=\"icon\" src=\"wb/gtht/home/img/icon4.png\" />\n          <div class=\"title\">企业风险控制</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">通过结构化的企业关系，以及多维度的企业风险监控体系，监控企业的工商变更、经营异常、严重违法等风险，让企业风险无处可藏。</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n  </body>\n</html>"},"_expanded":true}]}